github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0106.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0111","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0111.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-1646","title":"Google Chrome V8 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Google Chrome V8 引擎中的 Array.prototype.concat 实现未正确考虑元素数据类型，远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 JavaScript 代码触发越界读取漏洞。该漏洞影响 Chrome 49.0.2623.108 之前的所有版本，攻击者只需诱使用户访问恶意网页即可触发，可能导致浏览器崩溃（拒绝服务）或潜在的其他危害。Google 已在 Chrome 49.0.2623.108 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-1646"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-03-29T10:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:42:19Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome 至 49.0.2623.108 或更高版本，该版本已修复 V8 引擎中 Array.prototype.concat 实现的越界读取漏洞。各发行版用户请及时安装对应安全更新：Debian 用户安装 DSA-3531，Ubuntu 用户安装 USN-2955-1，Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2016:0525，openSUSE 用户安装 openSUSE-SU-2016:1059。如无法立即升级，可在 chrome://settings/content/javascript 中禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2016/03/stable-channel-update_24.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2016-04/msg00000.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2016-04/msg00001.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2016-04/msg00039.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2016-0525.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2016/dsa-3531","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1035423","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-2955-1","https://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=594574","https://codereview.chromium.org/1804963002/","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201605-02","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-1646","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1646.md","https://github.com/tunz/js-vuln-db/blob/26d3f06008cbf95d05f066d2bf2a220deff491fc/v8/CVE-2016-1646.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2016/1xxx/CVE-2016-1646.json","ht