.577 及以上版本，Adobe AIR 升级至 21.0.0.176 及以上版本。由于 Flash Player 已于 2020 年底停止支持，建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 并迁移至 HTML5 标准。如暂时无法卸载，可在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件（Chrome: chrome://settings/content/flash；IE: 管理加载项中禁用 Shockwave Flash Object）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2016-03/msg00022.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2016-03/msg00023.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2016-03/msg00024.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2016-03/msg00032.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/84308","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1035251","https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/flash-player/apsb16-08.html","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201603-07","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-1010","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-10108.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-1010.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/59adead62d41f907bd4d8297210669925a301433/2016/1xxx/CVE-2016-1010.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-1010","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/08480241ef57d4c4abee6c051883b0fd90961f23/2016/CVE-2016-1010.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2016/CVE-2016-1010/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2016-1010.txt","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/116707.txt","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2016-1010","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2016/CVE-2016-1010.md","https://github.com/trietptm/Security-News/blob/e46fe769bfa56f60b70561bb4b637851150da4d0/XuanwuLab/2016/2016_04_07.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0099.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0004","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-0099","title":"微软 Windows Secondary Logon 服务本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows Secondary Logon Service 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，服务在处理请求句柄时未正确验证输入数据大小。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞通过构造恶意应用程序触发漏洞，获取系统管理员权限。受影响版本包括 Windows Vista SP2、Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8.1、Windows Server 2008 R2 SP1、Windows Server 2012 及 Windows 10 早期版本。该漏洞利用条件为攻击者需在目标系统上具有本地账户权限，通过运行特制应用程序实现权限提升。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-0099"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-03-09T11:59:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:36:55Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2016年3月安全更新 MS16-032（对应补丁 KB3143141/KB3143142 等，视具体 Windows 版本通过 Windows Update 自动更新或手动下载安装）。如无法立即打补丁，可临时禁用 Secondary Logon 服务（运行 services.msc 找到 \"Secondary Logon\" 设为禁用并停止）作为临时缓解措施，但会影响需要二次登录凭据的程序运行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/84034","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1035210","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2016/ms16-032","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39574/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39719/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39809/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40107/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-0099","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39574","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2016/CVE-2016-0099.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2016-0099/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2016/CVE-2016-0099.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-0099","https://github.com/Al1ex/WindowsElevation/blob/e8fa2760f0ea29d1cdc759c623021d5ab7b715e2/CVE-2016-0099/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2016-0099.txt","https://github.com/tanjiti/sec_profile/blob/325d4883b5fe156c18fd47e477e38a13d3899546/README_2017.md","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/local-exploits/25620.txt","https://github.com/0xT11/CVE-POC/blob/2b6f11c3712c0efb88ac3edeab3d0aafa1f7a090/2016/CVE-2016-0099.json","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2016/database/CVE-2016-0099/MS16-032-zcgonvh.md","https://github.com/zcgonvh/MS16-032"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0059","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0059.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-2389","title":"SAP xMII 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"SAP NetWeaver 7.4 中的 SAP Manufacturing Integration and Intelligence (xMII) 组件 15.0 版本存在目录遍历漏洞。该漏洞源于 GetFileList 函数对用户传入的 Path 参数缺乏充分的过滤验证，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 /Catalog 接口发送包含 ..（点点）序列的特制 HTTP 请求，利用路径遍历技术突破目录限制，实现读取服务器上任意文件，包括敏感配置文件、系统文件等。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，且攻击者可直接通过网络远程利用，无需任何权限。SAP 已在安全公告 2230978 中发布修复补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2016-2389"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-02-16T15:59:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:43:57Z","remediation":"立即应用 SAP Security Note 2230978 提供的补丁，将 SAP xMII 组件升级至 15.0 的修复版本。如无法立即打补丁，在反向代理或 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则，对 /Catalog 接口的 Path 参数进行过滤，拦截包含 `..` 或 `%2e%2e` 等目录遍历序列的请求，并限制 Path 参数仅允许访问白名单目录。同时建议禁用不必要的 /Catalog 接口对外暴露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","refere