ame":"2016/AVE-2016-0200.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-2388","title":"SAP NetWeaver AS JAVA 信息泄露漏洞","description":"SAP NetWeaver AS JAVA 的 Universal Worklist 配置存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用该漏洞可获取敏感用户信息，如用户名、邮箱地址等个人身份数据。该漏洞影响 SAP NetWeaver AS JAVA 7.1 至 7.5 版本，CVSS 评分 5.3，危害等级中危。SAP 已在安全公告 2256846 中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2016-2388"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-02-16T15:59:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:43:57Z","remediation":"立即安装 SAP Security Note 2256846 对应的补丁，该补丁可通过 SAP Launchpad 支持门户获取。如无法立即打补丁，可在反向代理或 Web 防火墙层面限制对 `/webdynpro/resources/sap.com/XXX/JWFTestAddAssignees` 路径的匿名访问，并禁用不必要的 Web Dynpro 应用作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/137128/SAP-NetWeaver-AS-JAVA-7.5-Information-Disclosure.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/145860/SAP-NetWeaver-J2EE-Engine-7.40-SQL-Injection.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2016/May/55","https://erpscan.io/advisories/erpscan-16-010-sap-netweaver-7-4-information-disclosure/","https://erpscan.io/press-center/blog/sap-security-notes-february-2016-review/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39841/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43495/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-2388","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39841","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-2388.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2016/2xxx/CVE-2016-2388.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-2388","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2016/CVE-2016-2388.rules","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/web-applications/25050.txt","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2016-2388.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/SSVC/data/2016/CVE-2016-2388.json","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2016/database/CVE-2016-2388/SAP_exploit-vah13.md","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2016/CVE-2016-2388.csv","https://github.com/vah13/SAP_exploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2016/POC-AVE-2016-0200.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2016/EXP-AVE-2016-0200.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0200.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0198","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-2386","title":"SAP NetWeaver J2EE Engine UDDI server SQL注入漏洞","description":"SAP NetWeaver J2EE Engine 7.40 的 UDDI（统一描述、发现与集成）服务器存在 SQL 注入漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 UDDI 服务发送特制的请求，注入任意 SQL 命令，从而实现对后端数据库的未授权访问、数据窃取、篡改甚至完全控制。该漏洞影响 SAP NetWeaver AS JAVA 7.1 至 7.5 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。SAP 已在安全公告 2101079 中发布修复补丁，建议用户升级至安全版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-2386"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-02-16T15:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:43:56Z","remediation":"立即应用 SAP Security Note 2101079 提供的补丁，升级 SAP NetWeaver J2EE Engine 至 7.40 对应支持包栈（Support Package Stack）的最新版本。具体操作：登录 SAP Service Marketplace → 访问 SAP Note 2101079 → 下载并部署对应 J2EE Engine 版本的补丁包。如无法立即升级，可在 SAP NetWeaver Administrator 中禁用 UDDI 服务或通过反向代理/WAF 限制对 /uddi/ 路径的外部访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/137129/SAP-NetWeaver-AS-JAVA-7.5-SQL-Injection.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2016/May/56","https://erpscan.io/advisories/erpscan-16-011-sap-netweaver-7-4-sql-injection-vulnerability/","https://erpscan.io/press-center/blog/sap-security-notes-february-2016-review/","https://github.com/vah13/SAP_exploit","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39840/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43495/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-2386","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39840","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-2386.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/6695f20ae08803f774b618dbe76c2549e17160e7/2016/CVE-2016-2386.json","https://github.com/vah13/SAP_exploit/blob/f12aa9cf69606c3c1cda066a4ece2e3b52b9029d/SQL_injection_CVE-2016-2386.py","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/fbb83465db9f8eb048237338aeda5d9d7fa146a4/2016/CVE-2016-2386/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-2386","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2016-2386.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2016/CVE-2016-2386.rules","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2016/2xxx/CVE-2016-2386.json","https://github.com/likekabin/AttackDetection/blob/d2919ba02c55b1500118d5463d0b27d689bb7ad5/CVE-2016-2386/cve-2016-2386.rules","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/web-applications/29436.txt","https://github.com/murataydemir/CVE-2016-2386"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2016/POC-AVE-2016-0198.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2016/EXP-AVE-2016-0198.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0198.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0022","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0022.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-0752","title":"Ruby on Rails Action View 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Ruby on Rails 的 Action View 组件存在目录遍历漏洞，攻击者利用应用程序对 render 方法的无限制调用，在路径名中提供 \"..\"（点号）序列，即可绕过目录访问限制，读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 Rails 3.2.22.1 之前、4.0.x 及 4.1.x 在 4.1.14.1 之前、4.2.x 在 4.2.5.1 之前、5.x 在 5.0.0.beta1.1 之前的版本。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发该漏洞，通过构造恶意请求即可实现文件读取，可能导致敏感配置信息、源代码等被泄露。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2016-0752"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-02-16T02:59:06Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:38:09Z","remediation":"立即将 Rails 升级至以下修复版本：Rails 3.x → 3.2.22.1，Rails 4.0.x → 4.0.x 最新补丁版，Rails 4.1.x → 4.1.14.1，Rails 4.2.x → 4.2.5.1，Rails 5.x → 5.0.0.beta1.1。同时禁止在 render 方法中使用未经校验的用户输入作为文件路径，对所有路径参数进行白名单校验与目录遍历字符（..）过滤，可在应用层中间件中统一拦截包含 .. 的请求路径作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2016-February/178044.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2016-February/178069.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2016-04/msg00053.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-updates/2016-02/msg00034.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-updates/2016-02/msg00043.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2016-0296.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2016/dsa-3464","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2016/01/25/13","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/81801","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1034816","https://groups.google.com/forum/message/raw?msg=ruby-security-ann/335P1DcLG00/JXcBnTtZEgAJ","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40561/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-0752","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40561","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2016/CVE-2016-0752.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/34ec06c5d813d44f4