T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2016-02/msg00025.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2016-02/msg00027.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2016-02/msg00029.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2016-02/msg00030.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2016-0166.html","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1034970","https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/flash-player/apsb16-04.html","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201603-07","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39462/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-0984","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/39462","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2016/CVE-2016-0984.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dc921ec141e7440fd3470029362df19a6f8f0c58/2016/0xxx/CVE-2016-0984.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-0984","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2016/CVE-2016-0984/README_KO.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/62e5337c76ac2818af560f8dae312ab7316af431/frontend/cve/CVE-2016-0984.html","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2016/CVE-2016-0984.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2016/CVE-2016-0984.json","https://github.com/fullhunt/0day-today-archive/blob/0215d767ce49116865643f4a65678289c41dfba4/data/25834.txt","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2016/mgasa-2016-0062.nasl","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2016-0984.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2016/POC-AVE-2016-0033.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0033.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0012","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0012.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-0957","title":"Adobe Experience Manager Dispatcher URL过滤规则绕过漏洞","description":"Adobe Experience Manager 的 Dispatcher 组件（版本低于 4.1.5）存在 URL 过滤器绕过漏洞。由于 Dispatcher 未正确实现 URL 过滤机制，远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求绕过 Dispatcher 的安全规则，直接访问受保护的资源或后端管理接口，进而可能导致认证绕过甚至命令执行。该漏洞影响 AEM 5.6.1、6.0.0 及 6.1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击无需任何权限，利用复杂度低，建议用户尽快升级 Dispatcher 至 4.1.5 及以上版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2016-0957"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2016-02-10T20:59:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:38:32Z","remediation":"升级 Adobe Experience Manager Dispatcher 模块至 4.1.5 或更高版本。对应 AEM 版本：5.6.1 升级至 4.1.5+，6.0.0 升级至 4.1.5+，6.1.0 升级至 4.1.5+。该漏洞已在 Adobe 安全公告 APSB16-05 中修复，可通过 Adobe Package Manager 安装最新 Dispatcher 模块。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层对 /libs/ 和 /content/ 路径实施严格的 URL 白名单过滤规则，阻止未授权的路径遍历请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/experience-manager/apsb16-05.html","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-0957.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2016/CVE-2016-0957.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4ccef9ea7c907d917b1608d60d73b12823bdfdf5/http/cves/2016/CVE-2016-0957.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2016/0xxx/CVE-2016-0957.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2016-0957.js","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2016-0957-2634.yaml","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/ffb5d23b5960ff79fb8a74aaab201a94fa442f5c/data/2016/CVE-2016-0957-fuckwbored_CVE-2016-0957-payloads.md","https://github.com/we1h0/SecurityManageFramwork/blob/e706461bdf5e2bc78e9fc59c66904b95e81e331e/cnvd_xml/2016-04-04_2016-04-10.xml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2016-0957_4.yaml","https://github.com/thdusdl1219/CVE-Study/blob/6bc0a2f8bf5ddd6089bc9ce22188a24c1d44d24e/CVEs/CVE-2016-0957/README.md","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2016-0957_%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%8D%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0012.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0003","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0003.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-0040","title":"Microsoft Windows 内核 权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows 内核权限提升漏洞（CVE-2016-0040）影响 Windows Vista SP2、Windows Server 2008 SP2/2008 R2 SP1 和 Windows 7 SP1 等版本。该漏洞源于微软 Windows 内核的内存访问控制保护机制缺陷，攻击者可通过精心构造的应用程序触发内核漏洞，绕过权限验证，实现对系统功能的未经授权控制，达到提权目的。用户无需额外权限即可通过恶意软件触发漏洞，漏洞利用过程可能涉及加载恶意驱动、触发内核调用、绕过安全检查等技术手段，最终导致攻击者获取系统管理员或内核级权限，能够任意读取/修改系统文件，安装后门，窃取敏感信息或破坏系统稳定性。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.8（危 重级），危害等级严重。微软已在后续安全更新中修复此漏洞，建议用户及时更新操作系统以获取最新补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-0040"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-02-10T11:59:06Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:36:50Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2016 年 2 月安全更新 MS16-016 (KB3124280)，适用于 Windows 7 SP1、Windows Server 2008 R2 SP1、Windows Vista SP2、Windows Server 2008 SP2。通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装对应补丁包。如无法立即打补丁，可暂时禁用本地用户账户的非必要权限、限制非管理员用户运行可执行文件、启用 Windows Defender 实时防护并部署 CVE-2016-0040 对应的 YARA 检测规则作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快通过 WSUS/WSUS Offline/SCCM 推送补丁至全网资产，并使用 Microsoft Baseline Security Analyzer (MBSA) 验证补丁安装状态。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1034985","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-u