问特制的恶意网站，利用此漏洞执行任意代码或造成拒绝服务（对象头损坏）。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，但需要用户主动访问恶意页面。CVSS 评分为 8.8，危害等级为高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2016-0034"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2016-01-13T05:59:22Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:36:49Z","remediation":"立即升级 Microsoft Silverlight 到 5.1.41212.0 或更高版本，并确保完全安装最新安全更新。如系统已过时或无法升级，可能需要部署应用程序虚拟化解决方案来隔离受影响的 Silverlight 5.1.41212.0 之前版本。如无法立即修复，可临时阻止未验证的网络流量到 Silverlight 运行时或配置 web 应用服务器以禁用 Silverlight 插件，请确保应用完整的补丁套件或安装 Windows 10/11 系统补丁 KB4056892，彻底修复问题","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1034655","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2016/ms16-006","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2016-0034","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2016/CVE-2016-0034.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/cf9c3ae88cb7ef3fbb07b1a3ca376caed892be03/2016/0xxx/CVE-2016-0034.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2016/CVE-2016-0034","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2016/CVE-2016-0034/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2016-0034.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/18f8914e401b3086d2483ccc3fd79a5028186684/frontend/cve/CVE-2016-0034.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad51007022161bcf4c63e713af3138cc91fa14f3/CVE/data/2016/CVE-2016-0034.json","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2016/database/CVE-2016-0034/CVE-2016-0034-Decompile-hybridious.md","https://github.com/wonderkun/crawler/blob/281e1d1564e073bd4c1322f63767c0f4fbfcf5eb/www.anquanke.com/CVE-2016-0034%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E4%B8%8E%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7.md","https://github.com/Ebiquity/CASIE/blob/2c8beef56d48e8de6599891c6a5e0e5f0d82e20c/data/source/267.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2016/POC-AVE-2016-0002.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2016/EXP-AVE-2016-0002.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2016/AVE-2016-0002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2016-0076","file_name":"2016/AVE-2016-0076.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2016-1000305","title":"guard-livereload guard-livereload 目录遍历漏洞","description":"这是一个影响 guard-livereload 的目录遍历漏洞。该工具的 live reload 服务器组件在路径验证方面存在缺陷，攻击者可通过发送包含目录遍历序列（如../）的特制 HTTP 请求，绕过目录限制读取任意文件。漏洞影响版本低于 2.5.2，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程执行此攻击，获取目标系统中的敏感文件，如配置文件、证书、源代码等。此类漏洞可能导致信息泄露和进一步的安全风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2016-1000305","GHSA-g65v-27r3-5p6m"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2016-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2016-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 guard-livereload 到 2.5.2 或更高版本（运行 bundle update guard-livereload 或修改 Gemfile 指定版本）。若暂时无法升级，可在 Web 服务器层面配置路径规范化校验，禁止访问包含 ../ 等路径遍历序列的请求，同时限制 livereload 服务仅监听本地回环地址（127.0.0.1）避免外部直接访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/27c668b52f6a76c76f28f451a227f266f609c67a/gems/guard-livereload/CVE-2016-1000305.yml","https://github.com/rubysec/rubysec.github.io/blob/5161c2f5834875c476a3100372797bb1bbf9ce5b/advisories/_posts/2016-02-04-CVE-2016-1000305.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/gem/guard-livereload/CVE-2016-1000305.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/357993977f72e369f2153b52815028afa3f5ba9d/2016/CVE-2016-1000305.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/3992c433913ae016739eb2e12ee6b850c772ff9d/docs/data/2016/CVE-2016-1000305.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cc8614a5d4c361e50a77c406e56ba42